{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q866582","formula":"C₃","hill":"C3","elements":["C"],"composition":{"C":3.0},"names":{"en":"Tricarbon","ru":"Триуглерод"},"descriptions":{"en":"Tricarbon (systematically named 1λ2,3λ2-propadiene and catena-tricarbon) is an inorganic compound with the chemical formula C2(μ-C) (also written [C(μ-C)C] or C3). It is a colourless gas that only persists in dilution or solution as an adduct. It is one of the simplest unsaturated carbenes.","ru":"Триуглерод (трёхатомный углерод) — химическое соединение, один из аллотропов углерода с химической формулой C3. Представляет собой бесцветный газ, который устойчив только при разбавлении в растворе. Это один из самых простых ненасыщенных карбенов."},"fame":11,"pubchemCid":6432003,"mass":36.03,"charge":0,"smiles":"[C-]#C[C+]","inchikey":"NVLRFXKSQQPKAD-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"6432003","atoms":3,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.435,"y":0.179,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":-0.379,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":1.435,"y":-0.937,"z":0.0,"el":"C"}],"bonds":[[0,1,3.0],[1,2,1.0]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q866582","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tricarbon","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A2%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%83%D0%B3%D0%BB%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/6432003","license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},{"role":"structure","name":"RDKit","url":null,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q52